Z||000000||Homicidal||09-14-2000||04:45 AM||||The other thread went off-topic.<P>I need someone to help me build the best box for 10" sub for the front compartment!<P>Any ideas?<P>BTW, I wanna BUILD it, not buy it.  Is there a way to replicate Subbox.com's box?||||reg||4
Z||000001||BroCar 87||09-14-2000||01:50 PM||||Hey Homicidal, I made my own sub box for the front. It somewhat replicates the Sub-box, minus the ports into the passanger compartment. I wasn't sure If I would be able to do that myself or not. Here is a picture of what I have  made. <BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/outspk_1.jpg"> <BR>It sounds good up there. I have a 375watt speaker being pushed by a 250watt amp. Here are the dimensions I used. Don't flame me for not using the correct dimensions because I didn't know at the time how to get the correct ones.<BR>It sounds good as hell anyways.<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/FrontCompartmentDimentions_1.jpg"> <P>IF that isn't readable, I can email them. It doesn't show up good on the PIP here.<P>------------------<BR>    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/NorthFLFieroSIG.jpg">    <BR>87 Coupe "IRON BEAST"<BR>84 SE (project)||||reg||6
